The Church of the Thirteenth Realm is based in [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/index|Haven]], and is lead by [[People/Althane/Ezekiel Grimm|Reverend Grimm]]. They preach about a paradise granted to them by a hidden realm that orbits [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]] and [[Geography/Althane/Realms/Ilkyne|Ilkyne]].

The ministers and law enforcement of the church are called Guardian Angels. All angels appear to be [[Bestiary/Realmtouched#Aasimar|Aasimar]], with halos or wings betraying their station from a distance. Curiously, the angels are able to cast spells without developing the telltale spellrings in their eyes.
